  "description": "This program stores the grades of 10 students in the Natural Language Processing class. Then, the program calculates the highest and lowest scores and display them.",
  "code": "public class GradeScores {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n    \n        int[] scores= {10,19,12,14,90,4,5,20,14,15};\n        \n        int max=scores[0];\n        \n        int min=scores[0];\n \n        for (int i = 0; i < scores.length; i++) {\n\n            if (scores[i]> max) {\n\n               max=scores[i];\n\n            }\n\n        }\n    \n        for (int i = 0; i < scores.length; i++) {\n\n            if (scores[i]< min)  {\n\n                min=scores[i];\n\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(\"Highest score is \" + max+ \"\\nThe lowest score is:\"+min);\n    }\n\n}",
